5"},{"id":"c-chenshu-024-yuanshu-xian:p002","text":"憲父君正曰：","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":50,"last_line":50,"raw_start":3781,"raw_end":3787,"raw_character_offsets":[3781,3782,3783,3784,3785,3786],"revision_id":1494985},"mentions":[{"id":"c-chenshu-024-yuanshu-xian:p002:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"憲","kind":"person","person_id":"6qj_3sw_6fo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-chenshu-024-yuanshu-xian:p002:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"君正","kind":"person","person_id":"hb9_2gq_205_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-024-yuanshu-xian","book_id":"b-chenshu-024","work_id":"w-chenshu","source_id":"s-chenshu-024-yuanshu-xian-ws1494985"},{"id":"c-nanshi-021-wangyu:p001","text":"瑒弟瑜字子珪，亦知名。美容儀。年三十，官至侍中。永定元年使齊，以陳郡袁憲爲副。齊以王琳故，囚之。齊文宣毎行，載死囚以從，齊人呼曰供禦囚。毎佗怒，則召殺之。瑜及憲並危殆者數矣，齊僕射楊遵彥毎救護之。天嘉二年還朝，復爲侍中。卒，諡曰貞子。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":0,"end":1,"surface":"瑒","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangyu:p001:m0000","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作瑒。"},{"start":2,"end":3,"surface":"瑜","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangyu:p001:m0002","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作瑜。"},{"start":4,"end":6,"surface":"子珪","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangyu:p001:m0004","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作瑜。"},{"start":34,"end":36,"surface":"袁憲","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangyu:p001:m0034","person_id":"6qj_3sw_6fo","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作憲。"},{"start":41,"end":43,"surface":"王琳","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangyu:p001:m0041","person_id":"hu7_m9r_hro","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作琳。"},{"start":77,"end":78,"surface":"